.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_OPEN_WITH_OPTIONS 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_open_with_options
.Nd open an ELF object from a filesystem path with explicit open flags
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_open_with_options "const char *path" "uint32_t flags" "elfobj_t **out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_open_with_options
opens and parses the ELF file at
.Fa path
using open behavior selected by
.Fa flags .
.Pp
Supported flags include
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_USE_MMAP ,
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_NOCOPY ,
and
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_LAZY_PARSE .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv ELF_OK
on success and stores the opened handle in
.Fa *out .
On failure, returns an
.Vt elf_err_t
code.
.Sh ERRORS
Possible errors include
.Dv ELF_ERR_STATE ,
.Dv ELF_ERR_IO ,
.Dv ELF_ERR_OOM ,
and parse/format failures from ELF decoding.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_open 3 ,
.Xr elf_open_memory_with_options 3
